{"id":8851816,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-transformer/merge_requests/8490","number":8490,"state":"closed","title":"修复FlashAttention TND布局下lseOffset越界写导致LSE输出inf问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8490","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-transformer/pulls/8490/issues","body":"## 描述\nFlashAttention infer 算子在 TND 布局下，CombineSplitKVRes 中 lseOffset 使用绝对 bIdx 计算偏移，当部分 batch 的 S1=0 时，有效 batch 的 lseOffset 越界写入，导致对应位置的 LSE 输出保留为预填的 inf（3e+99）。\n\n## 改动\n- FlashDecodeCompute 中新增 lseBatchOffset 计算，TND/NTD 布局下取 actualSeqQlenAddr[bIdx-1] 作为累积 S1 偏移（与 attenOutOffset 的 TND 处理保持一致）\n- CombineSplitKVRes 签名新增 lseBatchOffset 参数，两处 lseOffset 公式用 lseBatchOffset 替代 bIdx\n- 非 TND 布局下 lseBatchOffset 等于 bIdx，行为与改动前一致\n\n## 关联的Issue\n#3681\n\n## 测试\n- TND 布局，B=6，Q cumulative seqlen=[1,1,1,1,1,2]，验证 B=1 的 LSE 输出不再为 inf，写入位置正确落在 [10,19] 区间\n- 非 TND 布局下 lseBatchOffset=bIdx，原有行为不受影响\n\n## 类型标签\n- [x] \uD83D\uDC1B Bug 修复\n- [ ] ✨ 新特性\n- [ ] ⚡ 性能优化\n- [ ] ♻️ 重构\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDEA 测试\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCE6 构建/CI\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD27 配置变更\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDCDD 文档更新\n- [ ] ⬆️ 依赖升级\n- [ ] \uD83D\uDD12 安全修复\n- [ ] \uD83E\uDDF9 代码清理\n- [ ] ❓ 其他，请描述：","assignees_number":0,"assignees":[],"testers":[],"approval_reviewers":[],"labels":[],"created_at":"2026-07-08T22:27:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-25T14:32:02+08:00","closed_at":"2026-07-25T14:32:02+08:00","merged_at":"","draft":false,"can_merge_check":false,"prune_branch":false,"mergeable":false,"user":{"id":"68771b9430980b376fba17a0","login":"huang-chuhong","name":"huang-chuhong","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/huang-chuhong"},"head":{"ref":"fix/fa-tnd-lse-offset","sha":"089ee5dce49b7a0e80c4149d4401c6593db50b73","label":"fix/fa-tnd-lse-offset","repo":{"path":"ops-transformer_1220","name":"ops-transformer_1220","namespace":{"path":"huang-chuhong"},"full_name":"huang-chuhong/ops-transformer_1220","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/huang-chuhong/ops-transformer_1220.git"},"user":{"id":"6877